{"path":"contact.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" />
  <title>Connect — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Reach out to {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} for aromatherapy consultations, bespoke blends and retail inquiries. Safety-first guidance.">
  <style>
    :root{
      --bg1:#0f1724; --bg2:#0b1a2b; --accent:#ff7aa2; --accent-2:#7be6c7; --muted:#97a1b2; --card:#0e2330; --glass: rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      --radius:16px; --pad:24px; --max:1100px;
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, "Helvetica Neue", Arial;
    }
    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(160deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:#e6f7f0;}
    /* unique floating SVG pattern (also provide fallback asset reference) */
    .pattern-wrap{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;opacity:0.12;mix-blend-mode:screen;}
    .page{min-height:100vh;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;padding:48px 20px;}
    header{width:100%;max-width:var(--max);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:28px;}
    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}
    .logo{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:12px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(11,23,35,0.6);font-weight:700;color:#092225}
    nav{display:flex;gap:16px;align-items:center}
    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:600}
    nav a:hover{color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04)}
    main{width:100%;max-width:var(--max);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 420px;gap:28px;align-items:start}

    /* hero/contact card */
    .lead{background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.03), rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:var(--radius);padding:28px;box-shadow:0 10px 40px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);backdrop-filter:blur(6px)}
    h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:28px;letter-spacing:-0.02em}
    p.lead-desc{margin:0 0 18px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5}

    .grid-sm{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:12px}
    .meta{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center}
    .pill{background:var(--glass);padding:8px 12px;border-radius:999px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}

    /* contact form */
    .form-card{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:20px;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.02)}
    form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}
    label{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}
    input[type=text],input[type=email],select,textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#eafaf5;outline:none}
    textarea{min-height:110px;resize:vertical}
    .btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),var(--accent-2));color:#062423;padding:12px 16px;border-radius:12px;border:none;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}
    .muted-note{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)}

    aside{position:relative}
    .card-rt{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),rgba(255,255,255,0.01));border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.5)}
    .contact-line{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:12px}
    .contact-line strong{color:#fff}
    .small-map{width:100%;height:160px;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,34,28,0.6),rgba(3,11,18,0.6));display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700}

    footer{width:100%;max-width:var(--max);margin-top:44px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}

    /* responsive */
    @media (max-width:980px){main{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      header{padding-bottom:6px}
    }

  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="pattern-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
    <!-- Inline decorative SVG. Also keep an external fallback at assets/img/pattern.svg for build systems. -->
    <svg width="100%" height="100%" viewBox="0 0 1600 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="g1" x1="0" x2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#112a2b" />
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#071422" />
        </linearGradient>
        <pattern id="p1" width="120" height="120" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse" patternTransform="rotate(18)">
          <rect width="120" height="120" fill="url(#g1)" />
          <path d="M0 60 Q30 30 60 60 T120 60" stroke="#0b5c52" stroke-opacity="0.9" stroke-width="0.9" fill="none" />
          <circle cx="20" cy="20" r="2.5" fill="#ff7aa2" opacity="0.7" />
          <circle cx="100" cy="100" r="1.8" fill="#7be6c7" opacity="0.6" />
        </pattern>
      </defs>
      <rect width="100%" height="100%" fill="url(#p1)" />
    </svg>
  </div>

  <div class="page">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="logo" aria-hidden="true">A</div>
        <div>
          <div style="font-weight:800">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>
          <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">{{TAGLINE}}</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <nav aria-label="primary navigation">
        <a href="/">Nest</a>
        <a href="/services.html">Offerings</a>
        <a href="/blends.html">Blends</a>
        <a href="/shop.html">Emporium</a>
        <a href="/book.html">Reserve</a>
        <a href="/contact.html" style="color:#fff;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.04);">Connect</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="lead" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
        <h1 id="contact-heading">Let's craft your olfactory story</h1>
        <p class="lead-desc">Reach out to {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}} to discuss personalized blends, retail questions, or to schedule a consultation. We center safety and clarity — no medical claims — only supportive aromatic care and education.</p>

        <div class="grid-sm" style="margin-bottom:16px">
          <div class="pill">Local studio — {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
          <div class="pill">Retail + Custom Blends</div>
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap">
          <a class="btn" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}" role="button">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <a class="pill" href="tel:{{PHONE}}" style="text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted);">Call: {{PHONE}}</a>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-top:18px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)">
          <strong>Quick note:</strong> Aromatherapy is safe when used mindfully. If you have pregnancy, severe allergies, or are managing a medical condition, please consult your healthcare provider before using essential oils. We always recommend a patch test and careful dilution. (See FAQ on our Blends page for more safety guidance.)
        </div>
      </section>

      <aside>
        <div class="card-rt">
          <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:12px">
            <div>
              <div style="font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);font-weight:700">Contact</div>
              <div style="font-weight:800">{{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}</div>
            </div>
            <div style="text-align:right">
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)">Studio</div>
              <div style="font-weight:700">{{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="contact-line"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M21 15v4a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3" stroke="#7be6c7" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M3 6v-1a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h6" stroke="#ff7aa2" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M21 15c0-7.18-5.82-13-13-13" stroke="#ffb6d1" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><div class="muted-note">Phone</div><strong>{{PHONE}}</strong></div></div>

          <div class="contact-line"><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14" stroke="#7be6c7" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M3 8l9 6 9-6" stroke="#ff7aa2" stroke-width="1.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><div><div class="muted-note">Email</div><strong>{{EMAIL}}</strong></div></div>

          <div style="margin-top:10px" class="muted-note">Prefer to write? Use the form to share a little about your scent goals, sensitivities, and timeline. We aim to reply within 48 hours.</div>

          <div style="margin-top:12px" class="small-map" aria-hidden="true">Studio Map &mdash; {{CITY}}</div>
        </div>

        <div style="height:14px"></div>

        <div class="form-card" aria-labelledby="form-heading">
          <h2 id="form-heading" style="margin:0 0 8px">Send a note</h2>
          <form id="contactForm">
            <label for="name">Your name</label>
            <input id="name" name="name" type="text" placeholder="Aroma-seeker" required />

            <label for="email">Email</label>
            <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@domain.com" required />

            <label for="phone">Phone (optional)</label>
            <input id="phone" name="phone" type="text" placeholder="(###) ###-####" />

            <label for="interest">I'm writing about</label>
            <select id="interest" name="interest">
              <option>Custom blend</option>
              <option>Retail order</option>
              <option>Consultation</option>
              <option>Wholesale / Stocking</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>

            <label for="message">Brief message (sensitivities, preferences)</label>
            <textarea id="message" name="message" placeholder="I love warm, resinous notes..." required></textarea>

            <div style="display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between">
              <div style="font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);max-width:260px">By contacting {{BUSINESS_NAME}} you agree to a privacy-forward reply. We do not provide medical advice via email.</div>
              <div style="display:flex;gap:8px">
                <button type="submit" class="btn">Send</button>
              </div>
            </div>
          </form>

          <div id="response" style="margin-top:10px;font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)"></div>
        </div>

      </aside>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <div>© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — All rights reserved.</div>
      <div style="text-align:right">Designed for calm, crafted with care · <a href="/about.html" style="color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none">About</a></div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <script>
    // small client-side handler to create a mailto fallback and show confirmation
    document.getElementById('year').textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
    const form = document.getElementById('contactForm');
    const response = document.getElementById('response');

    form.addEventListener('submit', function(e){
      e.preventDefault();
      const data = new FormData(form);
      const name = data.get('name');
      const email = data.get('email');
      const phone = data.get('phone') || '';
      const interest = data.get('interest');
      const message = data.get('message');

      const subject = encodeURIComponent('Inquiry from ' + name + ' — ' + interest);
      const body = encodeURIComponent('Name: ' + name + '\nEmail: ' + email + '\nPhone: ' + phone + '\nInterest: ' + interest + '\n\nMessage:\n' + message);
      const mailto = 'mailto:{{EMAIL}}?subject=' + subject + '&body=' + body;

      // Open the default mail client as a convenient fallback for this static template.
      window.location.href = mailto;

      response.style.color = '#7be6c7';
      response.textContent = 'Opening your mail app to send the message. If nothing happens, please email {{EMAIL}} directly.';
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>"} 
{"path":"README.md","content":"This chunk contains the Contact page and a short README for the aromatherapy site template.

Files included in this bundle:
- contact.html : A standalone, accessible contact page styled with CSS and an inline decorative SVG pattern. It references placeholders that must be replaced during build or templating.

Placeholders present (must be replaced at deploy/runtime):
- {{BUSINESS_NAME}}
- {{TAGLINE}}
- {{PHONE}}
- {{EMAIL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}
- {{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}
- {{CITY}}
- {{STATE}}
- {{PRACTITIONER_NAME}}
- {{FAVORITE_BLEND}}  (not used on this page but reserved globally)

Notes and implementation details:
- Voice/Design: "mystic_modern" with a "bold_playful" layout — the contact page uses vibrant gradients, pill UI, and a friendly CTA.
- Safety: The content includes explicit safety-forward messaging: no medical claims, recommends patch tests and consultation with healthcare providers when appropriate.
- SVG pattern: The page includes an inline SVG background pattern for visual richness. For build systems that expect a separate asset, provide assets/img/pattern.svg (recommended) matching the style in this inline SVG to satisfy the global uniqueness requirement.
- No external fonts or CDNs are used; typography falls back to system fonts.
- Form behavior: The contact form uses a mailto fallback (static template friendly). Swap in a server endpoint or third-party form handler as needed; if you wire an API, replace the form submit handler.
- Navigation: The contact page uses varied nav labels (Nest, Offerings, Emporium, Reserve) to maintain subtle uniqueness across the site.

Accessibility and progressive enhancement:
- Semantic HTML and ARIA ids are used for headings and the navigation landmark.
- Decorative SVG is aria-hidden.

Recommended next steps when integrating into a larger site:
1. Replace placeholders with environment or CMS values.
2. Provide assets/img/pattern.svg as a separate file for caching and reuse.
3. Hook the form to your preferred messaging or booking back-end if you want direct server-side submissions.
4. Ensure the Blends and Shop pages include safety-forward FAQ content about dilution, patch testing, pregnancy, and pets.

License: This template chunk is provided as a UI scaffold. No medical advice intended. If you display health-adjacent content, ensure proper disclaimers and professional oversight.
"} 
BUNDLE_END
